# Slop Scrubber Hygiene Rule

1. Never commit debugging statements (`console.log`, `print("debug...")`, `debugger;`, `pdb.set_trace()`).
2. Never suppress errors with `except Exception: pass` or empty `catch {}` blocks.
3. Before finishing any task or PR, run `slop-scrubber scan --diff` and `slop-scrubber clean --diff`.
